.specify/spec.md:154:- Registers domain-specific tools via `ToolRegistry`
.specify/spec.md:165:- Observes tool execution through entry protocol
.specify/spec.md:171:- Generates text responses and tool calls
.specify/spec.md:174:- Validates tool calls against schemas
.specify/spec.md:183:- Maximum tool loop iterations enforce termination (prevents infinite loops)
